        <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-white">Silas "Shadowstep" Greycloak</strong> — umano tethyriano, 38 anni, Ladro 9
          (Maestro di Intrighi), Caotico Neutrale tendente al Buono. Ex-capogilda de <strong>Le Monete Fortunate</strong>
